# Project meta and workflow rules for Cursor

- Always read `.cursor/PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md` at the start of a session.
- Keep `.cursor/PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md` up to date whenever architecture/deps/flows change.
- Log every significant change in `.cursor/CHANGELOG.md` with a dated entry.
- Prefer updating shared docs in-repo (not ephemeral notes) so they’re visible in git history.
- When changing networking/auth/build config, verify entries are reflected in both files.

# Editor hygiene
- Do not commit secrets; ensure `local.properties` holds `webClientId` and `giphyApiKey`.
- Avoid widening cleartext traffic; prefer HTTPS or scoped network security config.
- For Ktor, externalize base URLs via BuildConfig and use `DefaultRequest` for headers.
